king on": "This dashboard empowers recruiters to get visibility into requisitions they are working on", "Current Recruiting Status shows what is active in your hiring pipeline right now including total open positions, candidates by stages, and a snapshot per position.": "Current Recruiting Status shows what is active in your hiring pipeline right now including total open requisitions, candidates by stages, and a snapshot per requisition.", "All ATS Positions": "All ATS Requisitions", "Snapshot by Position": "Snapshot by Requisition", "Search a Position...": "Search a Requisition...", "Open Positions by Department": "Open Requisitions by Department", "Current Open Positions": "Current Open Requisitions", "Positions Missed Target Time to Hire": "Requisitions Missed Target Time to Hire", "Emails sent exclude campaigns not specific to a position.": "Emails sent exclude campaigns not specific to a requisition.", "Activities by Position": "Activities by Requisition", "Position Title": "Requisition Title", "%(count)s positions had activity in the selected period.  %(count)s positions had activity in the same period previous year.": "%(count)s requisitions had activity in the selected period. %(count)s requisitions had activity in the same period previous year.", "Tell us about your community...": "Tell us about your talent pool...", "Exclude Rejection Reason": "Exclude Disposition Reason", "Community Stage": "Talent Pool Stage", "Community Campaign": "Talent Pool Campaign ", "Refer a friend": "Submit Referral", "Save Leads": "Save Prospects", "Refer a Friend": "Submit Referral", "Drop your friend's resume here.": "Drop your referral's resume here.", "Upload your friend's resume to see matching jobs.": "Upload a resume to see matching jobs.", "Upload your friend's resume and see jobs that match your friend's skills and experience": "Upload your referral's resume and see jobs that match their skills and experience", "Upload Your Friend's Resume": "Upload Your Referral's Resu