, "Delete plan": "Delete action", "Delete plan permanently?": "Delete action permanently?", "Once this plan is deleted, it cannot be recovered, and all collaborators will lose access.": "Once this action is deleted, it cannot be recovered, and all collaborators will lose access.", "Plan Name": "Action Name", "Send development plan reminder": "Send development action reminder", "No plans": "No development actions", "Top mentors": "Recommended connections", "Project Manager(s)": "Project Owner(s)", "Related Courses": "Recommended Learning", "No development plans": "No development actions", "Filter experts": "Filter connections", "Showing 1 Experts": "Showing 1 Connection", "My %(view)s": "My Direct Reports", "%(name)s's %(view)s": "%(name)s's Direct Reports", "/careerhub/search/people::Title": "Job Title", "/careerhub/people/search::Title": "Job Title", "Turning this on allows you to appear in other users' networking suggestions list": "If you turn this on, then others will know that you are open to, and have capacity, to be a mentor.", "Add jobs and skills to your career interest": "Add roles and skills to your career interest", "Only you can edit and track this plan until you share with others.": "Only you can edit and track this action until you share with others.    When you submit information to this profile, your management chain will be able to see your profile or your career development plan", "No Plans": "No Development Actions", "/careerhub::plans": "actions", "Manage my career interests": "Manage my Career Interests", "Create development plan for %(name)s": "Create development action for %(name)s", "Courses that will help you get this role": "Learning that will help you get this role", "Invite To Project": "Invite to join project", "Added by manager": "Added by project owner", "Add as project manager": "Add as project owner", "Welcome to your Career Hub": "Welcome to Microsoft Career Hub! Explore jobs at Marketplace > Jobs", "Domain change": "Discipline change", "We are unable to parse the resume at this time. Either the resume contains unsupported language or the resume is an image based resume that does not provide enough text data. Your resume has been saved to your profile. If needed, please add the information directly.": "We are unable to parse the resume at this time. Possible causes include access controlled files, password protected files, image files, and files that do not contain enough information. Your resume has been saved to your profile. If you would like to have your resume be viewable to Microsoft Recruiting, please ensure the file sensitivity is set to \"General\". This ensures that the resume and any other attachments are available for review by Microsoft Recruiting.", "No domain change": "No discipline change", "How to become a %(roleTitle)s": "Ways to grow towards %(roleTitle)s", "Create plan for %(name)s": "Create action for %(name)s", "View plans": "View actions", "/careerhub/team-planning::Plans": "Actions", "Search for project, job, name or keyword": "Search for project, name, or keyword", "Create Plan for %(name)s": "Create Action for %(name)s", "Cannot find role for user! Failed to fetch career paths": "Hello, Explorer! You may see limited to no personalized matches due to being in a specialized or VP+ level role. Explore opportunities using Explore Roles.", "Cannot find the role associated with user. Please contact admin": "Hello, Explorer! Career Navigator doesn't show personalized results for all roles yet, including some specialized roles, senior roles, or roles that are not posted. You can still explore opportunities that have been posted\u2014use Explore Roles to browse roles or search based on the skills you want to grow.", "Create plan from career interest": "Create action from career interest", "Add, edit, remove or highlight skills to your profile": "Skills you add here will be passed to your M365 People Skills profile as additional skills you have. In M365 People Skills, you can control whether skills you have are visible to others in M365 experiences such as Profile Card, Copilot for Work, and search. ", "/careerhub/profile::Assign Date": "Added On", "/careerhub/profile::Assigned": "Recommended", "/projects::Ideal Candidates Relevance": "Candidates Relevance", "Skills to gain": "Skills to grow", "Skills you've gained": "Skills you've grown", "< 2 Hours/Week": "< 2 hours/week", "< 4 Hours/Week": "< 4 hours/week", "< 10 Hours/Week": "< 10 hours/week", "< 20 Hours/Week": "< 20 hours/week", "The skills added/deleted here may not yet reflect in your external site profile.": "Skills shown here include those you are sharing from your M365 People Skills profile. The skills added/deleted here will be reflected in your M365 People Skills profile. In M365 People Skills, you can control whether skills you have are visible to others in M365 experiences such as Profile Card, Copilot for Work, and search.\n<br><br> \nIf you would like to learn more about setting up your skills profile, click <a href=\"https://aka.ms/BuildaRobustEmployeeProfile\" target='_blank'>here</a>", "We found skills you have according to data from remote systems.": "Skills you add here will be passed to your M365 People Skills profile as additional skills you have. In M365 People Skills, you can control whether skills you have are visible to others in M365 experiences such as Profile Card, Copilot for Work, and search. ", "We found course skills you have according to data from remote systems.": "Skills you add here will be passed to your M365 People Skills profile as additional skills you have. Course skills capture skills you may have developed via completed learning courses from Viva Learning. In M365 People Skills, you can control whether skills you have are visible to others in M365 experiences such as Profile Card, Copilot for Work, and search. ", "Projects and courses that will help you land a role you\u2019re interested in.": "Projects and learnings that will help you build the skills you want to grow. If you would like to know how these suggestions are generated, you can find more in our <a href='/r?ns=career_hub&evt=open_external_link&n=https://microsoft.sharepoint.com/sites/HRweb/SitePages/AITransparencyFAQs.aspx?xsdata=MDV8MDJ8di1zaGFuaWNoZW5AbWljcm9zb2Z0LmNvbXxiMTU5NjA4MjYzNDU0MWY0MjkwOTA4ZGNiZTExMGU4NHw3MmY5ODhiZjg2ZjE0MWFmOTFhYjJkN2NkMDExZGI0N3wxfDB8NjM4NTk0MjI3NjY1MDA0NjAwfFVua25vd258VFdGcGJHWnNiM2Q4ZXlKV0lqb2lNQzR3TGpBd01EQWlMQ0pRSWpvaVYybHVNeklpTENKQlRpSTZJazFoYVd3aUxDSlhWQ0k2TW4wPXwwfHx8&sdata=Wmp6anRIaWgxTXdNWXovamZjVVkyNUI4L1RXRUVwQm5YT21ybnNqOW5OYz0%3d' target='_blank'>transparency FAQ</a>.", "Projects and courses that will help you get the skill you\u2019re interested in.": "Projects and learnings that will help you build the skills you want to grow. If you would like to know how these suggestions are generated, you can find more in our <a href='/r?ns=career_hub&evt=open_external_link&n=https://microsoft.sharepoint.com/sites/HRweb/SitePages/AITransparencyFAQs.aspx?xsdata=MDV8MDJ8di1zaGFuaWNoZW5AbWljcm9zb2Z0LmNvbXxiMTU5NjA4MjYzNDU0MWY0MjkwOTA4ZGNiZTExMGU4NHw3MmY5ODhiZjg2ZjE0MWFmOTFhYjJkN2NkMDExZGI0N3wxfDB8NjM4NTk0MjI3NjY1MDA0NjAwfFVua25vd258VFdGcGJHWnNiM2Q4ZXlKV0lqb2lNQzR3TGpBd01EQWlMQ0pRSWpvaVYybHVNeklpTENKQlRpSTZJazFoYVd3aUxDSlhWQ0k2TW4wPXwwfHx8&sdata=Wmp6anRIaWgxTXdNWXovamZjVVkyNUI4L1RXRUVwQm5YT21ybnNqOW5OYz0%3d' target='_blank'>transparency FAQ</a>.", "Select a language": "No Proficiency Required", "You gained %(numSkills)s skills from this %(entityType)s. Add them to your profile to get better recommendations across Career Hub.": "You've developed %(numSkills)s skills from this %(entityType)s. Add them to your profile to get better recommendations across Career Hub.  Skills you add here will be passed to your M365 People Skills profile as additional skills you have. In M365 People Skills, you can control whether skills you have are visible to others in M365 experiences such as Profile Card, Copilot for Work, and search. ", "You gained %(numSkills)s skill from this %(entityType)s. Add it to your profile to get better recommendations across Career Hub.": "You've developed 1 skill from this %(entityType)s. Add it to your profile to get better recommendations across Career Hub.  Skills you add here will be passed to your M365 People Skills profile as additional skills you have. In M365 People Skills, you can control whether skills you have are visible to others in M365 experiences such as Profile Card, Copilot for Work, and search. ", "You gained 1 skill from this task. Add it to your profile to get better recommendations across Career Hub.": "You've developed 1 skill from this task. Add it to your profile to get better recommendations across Career Hub.  Skills you add here will be passed to your M365 People Skills profile as additional skills you have. In M365 People Skills, you can control whether skills you have are visible to others in M365 experiences such as Profile Card, Copilot for Work, and search. ", "You gained 1 skill from this project. Add it to your profile to get better recommendations across Career Hub.": "You've developed 1 skill from this project. Add it to your profile to get better recommendations across Career Hub.  Skills you add here will be passed to your M365 People Skills profile as additional skills you have. In M365 People Skills, you can control whether skills you have are visible to others in M365 experiences such as Profile Card, Copilot for Work, and search. ", "You gained 1 skill from this course. Add it to your profile to get better recommendations across Career Hub.": "You've developed 1 skill from this course. Add it to your profile to get better recommendations across Career Hub.  Skills you add here will be passed to your M365 People Skills profile as additional skills you have. In M365 People Skills, you can control whether skills you have are visible to others in M365 experiences such as Profile Card, Copilot for Work, and search. ", "Some variables could not be substituted: ": "Some variables could not be substituted: ", "This user does not have access to this feature set": "This user doesn\u2019t have an active profile in the Microsoft career hub.", "Enroll": "Access", "/projects::View Candidates": "View profiles", "/careerhub/projects/manage/pipeline::View Candidates": "View profiles1", "/careerhub/projects/manage::View Candidates": "View profiles2", "/careerhub/projects::View Candidates": "View profiles3", "Are you sure you want to delete the project? This action cannot be undone.": "Are you sure you want to delete this project from your profile? This will also delete the project for all contributors, and cannot be automatically undone.", "Add programs if your project is eligible to apply only by the program's audience. Projects without programs will be eligible for all. Program once linked and saved cannot be edited in the future and only can be unlinked from the project.": "Is your Project part of a specific program? If it is, please select the Program here. Please note that you will not be able to edit this section of your Project details or change the Program you have linked your Project to.  If you do need to change the program, please re-post the project.", "Development plans": "Development actions", "View shared plans": "View shared actions", "Get help from your mentor with your existing plans, or add structure to mentorship conversations and track progress.": "Get help from your mentor with your existing actions, or add structure to mentorship conversations and track progress.", "Help your mentee with their existing plans, or discuss creating a development plan to add structure to mentorship conversations and track progress.": "Help your mentee with their existing actions, or discuss creating a development action to add structure to mentorship conversations and track progress.", "Build meaningful connections with Career Hub": "Build meaningful connections with Microsoft Career Hub", "Meet once to get advice or network.": "Request a one-time introductory meeting - to get to know each other, exchange ideas, explore further opportunities.", "Meet regularly for 6 months to get support for career growth.": "Request to start a 6 month mentorship - a goal based relationship to learn and grow.", "/careerhub/people/search::Skills for discussion": "Select at least one skill", "/careerhub/people/search::No skills added": "Select at least one skill", "Find a mentor to grow your career": "Find a Mentor.", "A mentor provides guidance on topics like the roles and skills you want. Reach out to start building a relationship for professional and personal growth.": "Tap into a vibrant community of Microsoft mentors and gain the insights, feedback, and guidance you need to grow towards your goals. ", "We are excited to have you on board and appreciate your willingness to share your knowledge and experience with others.": "At Microsoft, anyone can be a mentor. Mentoring is a form of impact and a great development opportunity for both parties. Create your mentor profile today.", "Meet your colleagues": "Let us introduce you", "Chats may range from brief conversations to requests for mentorship and everything in between. Browse the recommendations below.": "We'll help you get connected with a colleague, and request a coffee chat - a one-time meeting to get to know each other, exchange ideas, explore further opportunities.", "/careerhub/people/coffee_chats::Active": "Accepted", "You'll be recommended as a mentor to colleagues seeking mentorship": "You'll show up as an available Mentor in People searches and Recommendations.", "You'll be recommended to colleagues for one-off conversations": "Colleagues who want to reach out for a one-off conversation will know you are open to getting connected.", "Hi %(recipientName)s,<br /><br />Would you be open to meeting for a coffee chat?<br /><br />Thank you,<br />%(senderName)s": "Hi %(recipientName)s,<br /><br />Your profile stood out to me, and I'd love the opportunity to connect to hear more about your experiences and career journey. Would you be open to a chat?<br /><br />Thank you,<br />%(senderName)s", "Hi %(recipientName)s,<br /><br />Would you be open to mentoring me?<br /><br />Thank you,<br />%(senderName)s": "Hi %(recipientName)s,<br /><br />I am reaching out to ask if you would consider being my Mentor.<br /><br />I find your profile to be aligned with my career growth goals and I\u2019d greatly appreciate the opportunity to learn from your experiences and perspectives.<br /><br />Thank you,<br />%(senderName)s", "Home | Eightfold Career Hub": "Home | Microsoft Career Hub", "My Profile | Eightfold Career Hub": "My Profile | Microsoft Career Hub", "%(pageName)s | Eightfold Career Hub": "%(pageName)s | Microsoft Career Hub", "Explore %(type)s | Eightfold Career Hub": "Explore %(type)s | Microsoft Career Hub", "Connect with your mentor to discuss how you can realign your goals, explore new learning opportunities, and create a plan to enhance your growth together.": "It\u2019s natural for mentorships to need a reset sometimes. Don\u2019t worry, it happens. Check out our resources for guidance: https://aka.ms/HowToNavigateChallengesGuide", "/projects::Department": "Organization", "Kick-off mentorship session": "Mentoring Kick-off session", "Mentorship session": "Mentoring session", "Set your first sessions with %(name)s": "Set your first session with %(name)s  *Please note that this is not currently synced with Outlook - you must set an appointment manually", "You'll receive an email once they respond to your invitation. On average, mentorship requests are answered within 3-5 days.": "Request sent! You should hear back from them soon. For more information on Mentoring check out https://aka.ms/mentoring", "Click here to check your requests statuses": "Click here to see the status of your requests", "Setting clear expectations is key to a successful mentorship. Make sure to communicate your commitment and availability.": "Make sure you and your Mentee are clear about what you both want from the mentorship.  Review the resources in the Knowledgebase below for a guide on how to accomplish this", "Setting expectations": "Build a solid foundation", "Nice work!": "You have reached the end of this mentorship.", "Thank you for your commitment to mentoring.": "Close the mentorship through a conversation about gratitude and celebrating progress. Discuss ways to stay connected. ", "It's time to check in": "You're half way through your mentorship", "Keep up the good work": "You're half way through your mentorship", "Remember, it's important to continue meeting regularly to get the most out of mentorship.": "It's a great practice to regularly check in on the health of your mentorship. What's working well? Are you making progress, is it time to revisit/ reconsider anything?\n", "Keep going, you've got this": "Keep going, you are in the driving seat", "Failed to send request. This user has already reached the limit of requests received.": "Oops it looks like this user is very sought after - they have exceeded the set daily limit of requests. Consider another connection or try requesting another day.", "Organization Projects": "All Projects", "Strongly agree": "5 - Strongly agree", "Agree": "4 - Agree", "Neither agree nor disagree": "3 - Neither agree nor disagree", "Disagree": "2 - Disagree", "Strongly disagree": "1 - Strongly disagree", "Program Admins": "Program Owners - note they need the proper permissions before being added.", "Your session has timed out. Please click the button below to login again and come back to this window. Do not close this window or hit the back button to avoid losing your work.": "Your session has timed out. Please click the button below to login again and come back to this window. Do not close this window or hit the back button to avoid losing your work.", "Set up a recurring session with %(name)s": "Set up a recurring session with %(name)s *Please note that this is not currently synced with Outlook - you must set a recurring appointment manually", "Feel free to add skills so that we can better match you to the right jobs.": "Skills shown here include those you've confirmed in, and added to your M365 People Skills profile as skills you have. Skills you add here will be passed to your M365 People Skills profile as additional skills you have. In M365 People Skills, you can control whether skills you have are visible to others in M365 experiences such as Profile Card, Copilot for Work, and search. Please note if you add any skills beyond what is shown in the drop down menu, they will not be synced with M365 People Skills.  The settings currently do not suppress your profile data from Project Owners. For example, even if you have hidden your skills, you will still appear in search results if a Project Owner runs a candidate search for a project using your skill as a filter. Ongoing user experience enhancements in progress.", "Recommended Courses for your skill interests": "Recommended Learning", "Hi %(senderName)s,<br />Thank you for reaching out to me. Unfortunately I am not able to connect in the near term. I wish you well.<br />Regards,<br />%(recipientName)s": "Hi %(senderName)s,<br />Thank you for reaching out to me. Unfortunately I am not able to connect in the near term. I wish you all the best.<br />Regards,<br />%(recipientName)s", "Please contact your HR/IT administrator to invite you to Eightfold.": "Please contact your HR/IT administrator to invite you to Microsoft Career Hub.  ", "Showing recommended courses": "Showing recommended learning experiences", "Find courses": "Find Learning Experiences", "Courses are perfect to kickoff the Development plan for anyone at any point in their career paths.": "Learning experiences are perfect to kick off the Development plan at any point in their career paths.", "Course Type": "Learning Type", "course": "Learning Experience", "How satisfied with mentorship are you?": "How satisfied are you with your experience using Career Hub to manage this mentorship?", "Ideal Candidates": "Archetypes", "/candidate/register::Select a country": "Select country/region of residence", "Community:": "Talent Pool: ", "Added as Ideal Candidate": "Added as Archetype", "/careerhub/my/jobs::Position Closed": "Not Selected", "/careerhub/my/jobs::Application Failed": "Not Selected", "Unarchive Position": "Unarchive Requisition", "Back to interview plan": "Back to assessment plan", "Explore the many ways you can grow here": "Explore the many ways to build your skills and grow", "Achieve your skill goals": "Build your skills", "Recommendations based on your skill interests you set. Some skills that can be gained from these are listed above.": " ", "Plan your career": "Explore Career Paths", "Personalize your experience and recommendations": "Personalize your experience and recommendations. If you would like to learn more about Microsoft roles, visit Role Library", "There are %(count)s open projects. To see relevant projects based on your profile": "The total number of projects in Projects marketplace is %(count)s . To see relevant projects based on your profile ", "Click here to look for mentors": "Click here to look for personalized recommendations for mentors", "Only recruiters managing jobs I apply to": "No, do not allow Microsoft Recruiting to see my profile as a potential match recommendation for roles I haven't applied for, based on AI insights.", "Any company recruiter worldwide": "Yes, allow Microsoft Recruiting to see my profile as a potential match recommendation for roles I haven't applied for, based on AI insights.", "Evergreen": "Parent", "Child Of Evergreen": "Child", "Schedule interview at %(company_name)s": "Schedule meeting at %(company_name)s", "Create interview plan": "Create assessment plan", "Create an interview plan and make hiring efficient.": "Create an assessment plan and make hiring efficient.", "You can still create interview plan in calibration page": "You can still create an assessment plan in calibration page", "Interview Feedback Center": "Feedback Center", "Interview feedback center": "Feedback center", "Interview Center": "Meeting Center", "No interviews found": "No meetings found", "It appears that no interviews have been scheduled for you.": "It appears that no meetings have been scheduled for you.", "Interview details": "Meeting details", "View interview details": "View meeting details", "Search Candidate, Interview, Feedback...": "Search Candidate, Meeting, Feedback...", "Data Privacy Agreement": "Data Privacy Notice", "Requests for all Positions": "Requests for all Requisitions", "Requests sent for my Positions": "Requests sent for my Requisitions", "Candidate name, assigned coordinator or position": "Candidate name, assigned coordinator or requisition", "Position/Recruiter": "Requisition/Recruiter", "/careers/settings::Job Recommendations based on your Profile and Match Score": "I would like to receive email notifications of newly open jobs that match my profile.", "/careers/settings::Notifications": "AI-enabled job alerts", "/careers/settings::Manage the frequency of notifications delivered to your inbox": "\n", "/careers/settings::Preferred Language": "Preferred language", "/careers/settings::Choose which recruiters can see your profile": "Choose whether you want your profile to be shown to recruiters when you receive an AI-powered recommendation to a role for which you have not yet applied to. This won't affect the job recommendations you see, and you can update this setting anytime. Microsoft Recruiting team can still find your profile through manual search.", "/careers/settings::Account Information": "Account information", "/careers/settings::Information about your Account": "Manage your account information", "No recommended projects. Showing similar projects.": "We currently don't have projects that are aligned with your current skills or role interests. However, you can explore some other projects.", "Minimum of 1 ideal candidates": "Minimum of 1 comparable skills profile", "/careerhub::Type to search": "Advanced Filter Search", "/careerhub/explore/jobs/apply::Upload your resume": "Upload your resume (U.S. applicants only: in compliance with applicable laws, Microsoft asks that you redact or remove any information that identifies your age, date of birth, or dates of attendance at or graduation from an educational institution):", "/careers/forms::Select files": "Upload a file", "/careers/forms/center::Add new accessibility request": "Add new request", "/careers/forms::No Assessment accommodation request": "You have no accommodation requests submitted yet\nUse this form to request accommodations or adjustments due to medical needs, disabilities or religious beliefs.", "Community Team updated": "Talent Pool Team updated", "Candidate dashboard": "Action Center", "/careers/dashboard::Candidate Dashboard | Microsoft": "Action Center | Microsoft", "/careers/applications::Careers at Microsoft": "Applications | Microsoft", "/careers/interviews::Careers at Microsoft": "Interviews | Microsoft", "/careers/interviews::microsoft Events": "Events | Microsoft ", "/careers/saved-jobs::Careers at Microsoft": "Saved jobs | Microsoft", "/careers/forms::Phone Number": "Phone number", "/careers/settings::You will receive email notifications for the active alerts.": "Save up to 10 searches by toggling on job alert on the search jobs page. You can also adjust the frequency of email alerts. Alerts are not sent when no new jobs have opened.", "/careers/forms/center::Careers at Microsoft": "Forms manager | Microsoft", "Select position": "Select requisition", "Add skills to get relevant recommendations.": "Add skills to get relevant recommendations.  Please note if you add any skills beyond what is shown in the drop down menu, they will not be synced with Viva Learning.", "/careers/saved-jobs::Saved Jobs": "Saved jobs", "/careers/dashboard::Building your profile can help you find opportunities to grow. Choose one option to get started.": "Building your profile helps recruiters know more about you and you\u2019ll be ready to apply for jobs. Just upload your resume file, then add any other info you\u2019d like to share or enter your info manually.", "/careers/dashboard::Create your profile with existing information": "Create your profile", "/careers/dashboard::Resume": "Upload resume", "/careers/dashboard::Upload your resume": "Upload file", "/careers/dashboard::Manual Entry": "Enter manually", "/careers/applications::Keep track of all your job applications, organized by their current status. Stay informed and manage your career journey efficiently and accurately.": "Keep track of all your job applications, organized by their current status.", "/careers/profile::Add something about yourself": "", "/careers/profile::Listing your previous jobs will improve recommendations and suggested skills.": "", "/careers/profile::Show what you've learned": "", "/careers/profile::Add education to enrich your profile and build your future network.": "", "/careers/profile::Showcase your experience": "", "/careers/profile::Submit": "Save", "You are about to apply to \"%(title)s\".": "NOTE \u2013 CLICKING CONFIRM MAKES YOUR PROFILE VISIBLE TO THE PROJECT OWNER.  \n\nYou are about to apply for the \"%(title)s\". Please be aware that the project owner will have access to your entire profile, including any attributes set to private, until your application is reviewed. This access is granted to allow a comprehensive assessment of your skills and suitability for the project. We recommend updating your profile to highlight your skills, maximize connection opportunities, and receive personalized insights. For more information on Profile Visibility Settings, please refer to the Profile Visibility Settings Document.", "Recommended Courses to achieve your career interests": "Recommended Learning to achieve your career interests", "Add atleast one interview to proceed": "Add atleast one assessment to proceed", "Strongly Disagree": "1 - Strongly Disagree", "Strongly Agree": "5 - Strongly Agree", "Neutral": "3 - Neutral", "You may receive email invites from project owners. You will need to %(link)s project email notifications separately.": "You may receive email invites from project owners. To further manage your project email notifications click here: %(link)s.", "Notify project managers with projects having open applications but no recent activity": "Notify project owners with projects having open applications but no recent activity", "Notify project manager when there are no applicants or assignees to their projects": "Notify project owner when there are no applicants or assignees to their projects", "Hi %(senderName)s,<br />Thank you for reaching out to me. I am happy to connect!<br />Regards,<br />%(recipientName)s": "Hi %(senderName)s,<br /><br />Thank you for reaching out. I am happy to connect and I look forward to speaking with you soon!<br /><br />Thank you,<br />%(recipientName)s", "Hi %(senderName)s,<br />Let's meet and discuss how I can be helpful to you first before I accept your mentorship request.<br />Best,<br />%(recipientName)s": "Hi %(senderName)s,<br />Let's meet and discuss how I can be helpful to you first before I accept your mentorship request. I am curious about your career goals and ideas for partnership.<br />Best,<br />%(recipientName)s", "<p>Hi %(senderName)s,</p><p>Let's meet and discuss how I can be helpful to you first before I accept your mentorship request.</p><p>Best,</p><p>%(recipientName)s</p>": "<p>Hi %(senderName)s,</p><p>Let's meet and discuss how I can be helpful to you first before I accept your mentorship request. I am curious about your career goals and ideas for partnership.</p><p>Best,</p><p>%(recipientName)s</p>", "project manager": "project owner", "project managers": "project owners", "ic5": "IC5", "Duplicate from position": "Duplicate from requisition", "Position template*": "Requisition template*", "Template for this position is unavailable or inactive.": "Template for this requisition is unavailable or inactive.", "Duplicate position": "Duplicate as sourcing pipeline", "Could not duplicate position.": "Could not duplicate as sourcing pipeline.", "Position marked as priority": "Requisition marked as priority", "Position marked as %(status)s": "Requisition marked as %(status)s", "Position was %(status)s": "Requisition was %(status)s", "Position was unarchived": "Requisition was unarchived", "This will hide the position from your dashboard. You can always find it again by searching by name or job id.": "This will hide the requisition from your dashboard. You can always find it again by searching by name or req id.", "Please change position name in successfactors": "Please change requisition name in successfactors", "I agree to the above": "Yes, I would like to receive electronic communications from Microsoft Recruiting, including updates about events, news, career opportunities, and direct outreach from recruiters.", "Profile Visibility Consent": "AI-insights visibility to Microsoft Recruiting", "Please change position name in": "Please change requisition name in", "Community": "Talent Pool", "any": "Any", "Candidate name or position": "Candidate name or requisition", "Positions with incomplete calibration": "Requisitions with incomplete calibration", "POSITION": "REQUISITION", "S&#39;identifier en utilisant LinkedIn": "Se connecter en utilisant LinkedIn\t", "Send Rejection Email": "Send disposition email", "Send rejection email on": "Send disposition email on", "Send rejection email on:": "Send disposition email on:", "What positions would you like to hire for in this event?": "What requisitions would you like to hire for in this event?", "Add Target Positions": "Add Target Requisitions", "Add to your event the positions you want to hire for.": "Add to your event the requisitions you want to hire for.", "All