pplication process, read more about <a href=\"https://careers.microsoft.com/v2/global/en/accessibility.html\"\\><b><u>requesting accommodations.</u></b></a></small>", "/events/open::microsoft Events": "Events | Microsoft", "/careers/events::microsoft Events\t": "test", "/events/::microsoft Events\t": "test", "/events/open?domain=microsoft::microsoft Events\t": "test", "/events/open?domain=microsoft.com::microsoft Events": "test", "/events/domain=microsoft.com::microsoft.com": "test", "/events/::microsoft Events::microsoft.com": "test", "Explore Events": "Explore events", "All Dates": "All dates", "Position Location(s)": "Application location(s)", "For each position, select the location you want to apply for.": "Please select location(s) below. This will prompt work authorization questions.", "/candidate_experience::Name*": "Preferred name*", "/candidate_experience::I Agree": "I agree", "/events/open?domain={{domain}}::microsoft Events": "Test", "%(user)s added to community": "%(user)s added to talent pool", "/candidate_experience::Update Contact Details": "Update contact details", "{} new job(s) for:": "{} new job(s) at Microsoft for:", "{}+ new job(s) for:": "{}+ new job(s) at Microsoft for:", "(Last updated on %(lastModified)s)": " ", "%(company) Events": "Microsoft events", "/careers::Search for job title or keywords": "Search by job title, ID, or keyword", "/careers::Search for location": "City, state, or country/region", "/form-submissions::Disposition": "Reject", "%(company)s Events": "Events | Microsoft Careers", "Resume (Optional)": "Resume (optional)", "Phone Number": "Phone number", "/screening::Department": "Discipline", "/screening::Business Unit": "Org Executive Summary", "Application questions": "Candidate questions", "Self-identification - Belfast Only": "Self-identification", "Self-identification - US/Puerto Rico": "Self-identification", "Self-identification - Global": "Self-identification", "/careerhub/my/jobs::Job Family": "Discipline", "/unsub::Unsubscribe from email updates and news about %(company)s": "By opting out, you will no longer receive general marketing communications, including updates about events, news, and career opportunities from us. However, opting out will not impact any communications related to positions you have applied for or other employment-related processes associated with those positions.", "Open in Browser": "Preview in Browser", "/position/pipeline_v2::Edit Application Details": "Update Assigned To", "Associate candidate to a position": "Associate candidate to a requisition", "Draft": "Pre-Approved", "cannot advance because candidate is on Extend Offer for another position": "cannot advance because candidate is on Extend Offer for another requisition", "/careers::Matching Skills": "Matched for", "/careerhub::Draft": "Draft", "Sync from ATS": "Manual SuccessFactors Sync", "Please specify the reason for using Sync from ATS": "Sync between Eightfold and SuccessFactors is scheduled to run every 60 seconds. To help our Admin team better understand potential issues, please select a reason below for manual initiation:", "Please specify here if any other reason. Feel free to file a support ticket via Get Help too.": "Please specify here if any other reason.  Feel free to file a support ticket.", "Personal accept message": "TEST", "Congratulations! We're excited to extend a job offer. Review your offer letter in the attached document and sign electronically when ready": "We're delighted to extend an offer to you. Please view and sign the offer documents. If you have any questions, please contact us. Congratulations!", "/careers/join::Interested In": "Desired area of work", "Thanks For Joining Our Talent Network!": "Thank you for joining our Talent Network!", "We will get back to you if there is a good fit.": "We appreciate your interest in Microsoft and will be in touch with relevant updates, events, and opportunities.", "/careers/join::Browse More Jobs": "Browse jobs", "Login To View Profile": "Login to view profile", "/home::Duplicate Position": "Duplicate as Sourcing Pipeline", "Preferred location for %(title)s": "Where would you like to apply for %(title)s", "Building your profile can help you find opportunities to grow. Choose one option to get started.": "Building your profile helps recruiters know more about you and you'll be ready to apply for jobs. Just upload your resume file, then add any other info you'd like to share or enter your info manually.", "Campaign Consent": "Communication preferences", "/careers/settings::Campaign Consent": "Communication preferences", "Offer extended": "Offer", "Questions for %(position)s": "Job specific questions for %(position)s", "/careers/applications::Application Submitted": "Submitted", "/careerhub::Drag & drop file": "Drag & drop file", "Please Upload Resume": "Please upload resume", "Current Location": "Current location", "Preview and copy from calibrations": "Copy calibration for sourcing pipeline only", "positions": "requisitions", "position": "requisition", "Invalid external publish schedule": "Past/Current Date not valid for scheduling posting", "No matching positions": "No matching requisitions", "Associate %(numCandidates)s candidate(s) to a position": "Associate %(numCandidates)s profiles(s) to a requisition", "There are no positions matching your search criteria": "There are no requisitions matching your search criteria", "/profile-v2::Edit Additional Info": "Edit Candidate Info", "We already have %(name)s in our database. You can always refer someone else": "This candidate has already been referred to this job by a Microsoft employee", "/form-submissions/response/::Reject": "Reject", "/form-submissions/response::Reject": "Reject", "Successfully edited additional info.": "Successfully edited candidate info.", "Cannot advance because candidate is on Extend Offer for another position": "Cannot advance because candidate is on Extend Offer for another requisition", "%(num)s Candidate added to ": "%