check back soon for updates.", "You haven't connected with a mentor yet. Browse mentors in this hub and send a request to get started.": "You haven't connected with a mentor yet. Browse mentors in this community and send a request to get started.", "Archive hub?": "Archive community?", "/careerhub::There aren't any projects in this hub yet. You can browse projects outside of this hub or check back soon for updates.": "There aren't any projects in this community yet. You can browse projects outside of this community or check back soon for updates.", "/careerhub::Note that a hub cannot be added once it's delinked from a project": "Note that a community cannot be added once it's delinked from a project", "The following admin profiles do not have permission to manage hubs: %(invalid_admin_list)s": "The following owner profiles do not have permission to manage communities: %(invalid_admin_list)s", "/careerhub::Remove as program admin": "Remove as community owner", "/careerhub::Hub member eligibility": "Community member eligibility", "/careerhub::No hubs found": "No communities found", "/careerhub::Program Audience Criteria": "Community Audience Criteria", "Hub published successfully": "Community published successfully", "Browse hub mentors": "Browse community mentors", "Mentoring for %(program)s of your hubs": "Mentoring for %(program)s of your comunnities", "Mentoring for %(hub)s of your hubs": "Mentoring for %(hub)s of your comunnities", "Mentoring for %(count)s of your hubs": "Mentoring for %(count)s of your communities", "Also a member of %(count)s of your hubs": "Also a member of %(count)s of your communities", "/careerhub::Failed to update Hub. Please try again.": "Failed to update Community. Please try again.", "/projects/manage/pipeline::Hub": "Communities", "Hub created successfully": "Community created successfully", "/careerhub/programs/edit::Give people a quick idea of what this hub is": "Give people a quick idea of what this community is", "/careerhub/programs::Hub created successfully": "Community created successfully", "Hub archived successfully": "Community archived successfully", "/careerhub/programs::Hub archived successfully": "Community archived successfully", "Resume exceeds the size limit of 500K. Please upload a new resume for this profile. ": "Resume exceeds the size limit of 5MB. Please upload a new resume for this profile.", "/careerhub/explore/projects::This project is part of a hub. As you belong to the hub member, you are eligible to apply to this project.": "This project is part of a community. As you belong to the community member audience, you are eligible to apply to this project.", "My Hubs": "My Communities", "Hub": "Communities", "Click \u201c+\u201d to add.": "Click \u201c+\u201d if you'd like to add them to your profile.", "You gained %(count)s skills from this %(entityType)s. Add them to your profile to get better recommendations across Career Hub.": "You've developed %(count)s skills from this %(entityType)s. Add them to your profile to get better recommendations across Career Hub.", "/careerhub::The page you are trying to access has restricted access. Contact your system administrator.": "The page you are trying to access has restricted access. Contact your system administrator.", "/careerhub/settings::Account Test": "Account Settings", "Add skills to your profile that showcase your strengths and experiences. Focus on skills that align with your current capabilities, as these will help drive opportunity matching. In the next screen you'll have the opportunity to add skills that you're growing. <br><br>Skills shown here include those you've confirmed in, and added to, your M365 People Skills profile as skills you have. Skills you add here will be passed to your M365 People Skills profile as additional skills you have. In M365 People Skills, you can control whether skills you have are visible to others in M365 experiences such as Profile Card, Copilot for Work, and search.": "Add skills to your profile that showcase your strengths and experiences. Focus on skills that align with your current capabilities, as these will help drive opportunity matching. In the next screen you'll have the opportunity to add skills that you're growing. <br><br>Skills shown here include those you've confirmed in, and added to, your M365 People Skills profile as skills you have. Skills you add here will be passed to your M365 People Skills profile as additional skills you have. In M365 People Skills, you can control whether skills you have are visible to others in M365 experiences such as Profile Card, Copilot for Work, and search.", "What skills are you looking to grow?<br><br>Skills shown here include those you've said you are growing in your Viva Learning profile.<br><br>Skills you add here will be passed to your Viva Learning profile as additional skills you are growing. Skills that you are growing are private to you in both Microsoft Career Hub and Viva Learning. They are not visible to others. Please note if you add any skills beyond what is shown in the drop down menu, they will not be synced with Viva Learning.": "What skills are you looking to grow?<br><br>Skills shown here include those you've said you are growing in your Viva Learning profile.<br><br>Skills you add here will be passed to your Viva Learning profile as additional skills you are growing. Skills that you are growing are private to you in both Microsoft Career Hub and Viva Learning. They are not visible to others. Please note if you add any skills beyond what is shown in the drop down menu, they will not be synced with Viva Learning.", "/careerhub/people/search::Mentoring topics": "Mentor Topics", "/careerhub/people/search::Work Experience": "Previous Employers", "/careerhub/programs/edit::Mentoring topics": "Mentor Topics", "/careerhub/programs/edit::Title": "Job Title", "/careerhub/programs/edit::Work Experience": "Previous Employers", "/careerhub/my/programs::Leave this hub as a member": "Leave this c