 this mentorship to provide more context to your mentor", "Profile ineligible for position as configured by your organization": "DISREGARD GTA Ops Use Only", "/position/pipeline_v2::Copy Calibration": "LEAVE UNCHECKED - DO NOT COPY CALIBRATION", "/refer::Required fields are indicated with": "Please ensure the uploaded resume belongs to the candidate you intend to refer. \n Note:  Current employees should not be submitted through the referral process. \n Required fields are indicated with ", "/referrals::Required fields are indicated with": "Please ensure the uploaded resume belongs to the candidate you intend to refer. \n Note:  Current employees should not be submitted through the referral process. \n Required fields are indicated with ", "Availability and accuracy of resume scanner may vary by language": "Upload your resume (U.S. employees only: in compliance with applicable laws, Microsoft asks that you redact or remove any information that identifies your age, date of birth, or dates of attendance at or graduation from an educational institution. Ensure file sensitivity is set to \"General\" so that the resume is available for review by Microsoft Recruiting)", "Missing answers for required questions. Please refresh the page and try again": "Please complete all required fields. Update your EC profile (aka.ms/EC) for missing contact info.", "Error submitting application": "Please complete all required fields. Update your EC profile (aka.ms/EC) for missing contact info.", "/careerhub/myprojects/managed::All Hubs": "All Communities", "This job is not open for applying at this moment.": "This job is no longer accepting applications"}};